      "content": "That sounds good, but I'm a bit worried. There's that pending legal challenge on the main patent—the one regarding the processing algorithm. If Nebula's lawyers dig into recent filings, they're going to see the risk of invalidation. Should I mention the challenge during the session, or just stick to the \"value in use\" angle you suggested?",
